No, I mean I think that the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:14.640
director automatically wants respect&nbsp;
but they don't necessarily deserve it.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:21.900
When you see frustration from directors it's&nbsp;
because they don't have any respect and people&nbsp;&nbsp;

