are just walking all over him that usually comes&nbsp;
from a director that is not prepared or not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:33.060
prepared and just not doing the job&nbsp;
that they're supposed to be doing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:40.800
