00:01:07.740 --> 00:01:12.840
to all these other departments and if they&nbsp;
don't have your respect they are not going to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:18.720
be delivering their best work more than likely&nbsp;
because if they don't like you, if they don't&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:23.520
respect you or don't want to be there, they're&nbsp;
going to probably just try to they're just trying&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:29.580
to power through the day that's a really bad that&nbsp;
you don't want your team members in that position&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.780 --> 00:01:35.820
and I don't think that that if you find&nbsp;
yourself in that position it's this is not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:39.900
necessarily because you have experience&nbsp;
